{
  "name": "dsh-whale-decor",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Deep-sea whale-blue reskin for the DSH Web GUI: 14 theme tokens (light and dark), five whale-tail-maid placements, a clock and weather card, and a collapsible hardware readout. | 给 DSH Web GUI 的深海鲸蓝换肤：14 个主题 token、5 处鲸尾女仆角色元素、时钟与天气卡片，以及可上下伸缩的硬件状态悬浮窗。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "src/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./src/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "src/",
    "lib/client.js",
    "assets/files/",
    "assets/index.json",
    "assets/ATTRIBUTION.md",
    "assets/dsh-pet-LICENSE.txt",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    },
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "theme",
    "skin",
    "decoration",
    "ui"
  ],
  "author": "RIAN",
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test/host.test.mjs && node test/client.test.mjs"
  }
}
